cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AM-MultiModal-Monitoring: an integrated in-situ monitoring system for metal additive manufacturing with a detectability bound"
abstract: >-
  Code and documentation for a multi-modal in-situ monitoring system for laser
  powder-bed fusion and directed energy deposition, extended with a closed-form
  bound on what any detector could achieve given the sensing chain. The monitoring
  system is the applied half; the bound itself is the separate detectability-bound
  package, vendored here at a pinned commit.
